wall is what made me first notice this trend with the game</div> </div> </div> </div>You certainly have a point in that if everyone has all the common Disciplines it gets watered down. Even if the common Disciplines supposedly are called &quot;common&quot; for a reason.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/970-gurkhal","name":"Gurkhal","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"863"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-01T23:17:20-08:00","id":1529847,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Gurkhal</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529846#post1529846\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> You certainly have a point in that if everyone has all the common Disciplines it gets watered down. Even if the common Disciplines supposedly are called &quot;common&quot; for a reason.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope Willem has celerity so that scene makes sense lorewise, realistically every neonate would likely have a dot in one or two of the physical disciplines and he seems the type to want a quick getaway.<br /> <br /> But if they make every vamp able to move so fast they aren't even a blur and punch people across the room then how powerful are they gonna make someone with a dot of potence or celerity, are Brujah outrunning and throwing cars around the same night they're embraced in TCR's vision of the series?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28284-abugintherug","name":"abugintherug","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28284_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T08:07:49-08:00","id":1529854,"title":"","content":"Mind you, I think we can all agree that vampires ONLY having their Clan's three disciplines in games is nonsense.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T12:46:06-08:00","id":1529864,"title":"","content":"I never stuck with only using in clan Disciplines for my characters at all, I went with what fit with my idea of whom I wanted my player character was building in my mind.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;Power that needs to advertise itself is already losing&quot; Grand Admiral Thrawn <br /> <br /> &quot;Coronation Starscream? This is bad comedy!&quot; Galvatron","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27361-lysander","name":"Lysander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27361_11.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Mar 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"3523"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T14:58:14-08:00","id":1529868,"title":"","content":"You dont seem to be getting my point. I'm saying I hope those are actually the physical disciplines being used to do superhuman things and its not just the baseline for every vamp. A 15 second Tremere reveal shouldn't be showcasing what appears to be Potence","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28284-abugintherug","name":"abugintherug","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28284_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T15:18:03-08:00","id":1529871,"title":"","content":"The way it's presented right now is that no matter what Clan you pick, you have a light punch, heavy punch, telekinesis and the option to float after jumping. They mentioned there's an in-story reason for why Phyre can use telekinesis, so who knows what that's about. But the punches coming with knockback-effects and heavy punches having some areal effect as well is something you always have, it seems like.<br /> <br /> We've also seen in the trailer that the game doesn't have an inventory- or equipment-system (outside of picking an outfit). Unless there's some option in the ability-tree to maybe pick up weapons via telekinesis and use those, you're probably just gonna use those fists as your main-weapons during the whole game.<br /> <br /> And I think it's only somewhat tied to Disciplines. The excuse for what Phyre generally can do is that she's an Elder and all the in-game-story stuff with the sigil. Then picking a Clan means you get four extra abilities to use in combat (two of which you need to unlock first in the ability-tree from the looks of it) and you get a bonus-effect for a couple seconds after you feed. For Brujah the effect gave them more melee-damage. I assume it will be something similar with the other Clans (movement-speed-increase, detection-speed-reduction, increased range for abilities, etc... of course I don't know what it will be exactly but I imagine it's something along those lines). They will take inspiration from the ttrpg but I don't think it will hone close to the same Discipline-categorization. The governing structure to this is oriented around the gameplay and how they set things up rather than modeling the game after what you would see on a VtM-char-sheet.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-02T15:53:32-08:00","id":1529873,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529871#post1529871\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">They will take inspiration from the ttrpg but I don't think it will hone close to the same Discipline-categorization. The governing structure to this is oriented around the gameplay and how they set things up rather than modeling the game after what you would see on a VtM-char-sheet.</div> </div> </div> </div>Ah I was sorta worried that was the case, but as long as it makes combat fun to play then I won't complain","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/28284-abugintherug","name":"abugintherug","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar28284_2.jpg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2023"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"20"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T04:39:33-08:00","id":1529894,"title":"","content":"If anybody wants to know, here's the current like/dislike-ratio for the extended game-play-reveal on YT:<br /> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"1283\" height=\"216\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5GEyFOj.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/5GEyFOj.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/5GEyFOj.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <br /> Never a good sign when these sorts of videos get ratioed by the community.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T04:58:52-08:00","id":1529895,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529894#post1529894\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">If anybody wants to know, here's the current like/dislike-ratio for the extended game-play-reveal on YT:<br /> <div class=\"img_align_center_wrapper\"><img width=\"1283\" height=\"216\" data-align=\"center\" data-size=\"full\" loading=\"lazy\" border=\"0\" src=\"https://i.imgur.com/5GEyFOj.png\" alt=\"\" data-fullsize-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/5GEyFOj.png\" data-thumb-url=\"https://i.imgur.com/5GEyFOj.png\" data-title=\"Click on the image to see the original version\" data-caption=\"\" class=\"bbcode-attachment align_center js-lightbox bbcode-attachment--lightbox\" itemprop=\"image\"/></div><br /> <br /> Never a good sign when these sorts of videos get ratioed by the community.</div> </div> </div> </div>The hatred of the community in White Wolf is getting to Star Wars levels, sadly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83e\udd22","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T05:32:15-08:00","id":1529896,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529895#post1529895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The hatred of the community in White Wolf is getting to Star Wars levels, sadly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, but the way Paradox and Chinese Room have handled the previews thus far was also counterproductive. The 15-second Clan videos are a great case-study in bad PR. And then to even let it all end with a whimper in the form of the Ventrue non-reveal where they couldn't even show off 15 seconds... And people love BL1 for its roleplaying-aspects - which they still haven't shown off. If anything, showing the roleplaying-gameplay in the non-combat-sections would have been the more relevant thing to show off to BL1 fans. Unless of course, the game doesn't really have any of the sort and is quite linear instead. But then you'd already know anyway that BL1 fans won't react positively.<br /> <br /> Or the introduction of Phyre as the main-protagonist... they handled that horribly. Of course, it's a named and voiced character like a Shepard but you'd think they'd show off customizability by introducing the female and the male voice/model and then show the character-creation-screen at the beginning where you can modify the face, hair etc. (you know, the stuff you do at the start of most RPG videogames). Instead, I still occasionally see comments where people believe you have to play a female Phyre and her look can't be changed. But of course, they'd think that because the previews thus far are strictly limited to female Phyre and one particular look.<br /> <br /> Personally, I think they would've been better off to have waited till this Summer to start previews. Because the only way it makes sense to me is that it's handled this horribly because there's a lot they simply <i>can't</i> show off right now. And the previews are more stop-gap-measures than anything else. As far as first impressions go, though, that wasn't a good move.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":4}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T06:51:05-08:00","id":1529900,"title":"","content":"Yeah, I'm guessing they keep showing the same thing off, because that's basically the only part of the build they have completed to the point that they feel comfortable showing off. That's also why the clan previews were so short. The game is still in an alpha build and not in any shape to show off.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T07:23:10-08:00","id":1529903,"title":"","content":"I haven't really talked about this much, but I'll break my silence to say it probably would have been best just to cancel it after the whole Hardsuit Labs debacle, and especially after Paradox threw Avellone under the bus. VTMB was lightning in a bottle, and there was a microscopically narrow window of opportunity to capture it again. That's well and done, and however it shakes out at this point it'll never live up to hype or expectation from the small number of people who still follow the project.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529895#post1529895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The hatred of the community in White Wolf is getting to Star Wars levels, sadly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Is it really surprising after White Wolf and Paradox threw themselves headfirst into the culture war meat grinder, and made the conscious decision to stay there for half a decade? Nether &quot;side&quot; of that crap has any tendency to let bygones be bygones.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T10:50:52-08:00","id":1529917,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Theodrim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529903#post1529903\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I haven't really talked about this much, but I'll break my silence to say it probably would have been best just to cancel it after the whole Hardsuit Labs debacle, and especially after Paradox threw Avellone under the bus. VTMB was lightning in a bottle, and there was a microscopically narrow window of opportunity to capture it again. That's well and done, and however it shakes out at this point it'll never live up to hype or expectation from the small number of people who still follow the project.<br /> <br /> Is it really surprising after White Wolf and Paradox threw themselves headfirst into the culture war meat grinder, and made the conscious decision to stay there for half a decade? Nether &quot;side&quot; of that crap has any tendency to let bygones be bygones.</div> </div> </div> </div>Hardsuit Labs is the one who fired Mitsoda and Avellone before removing their content.<br /> <br /> Which Paradox Interactive then took the game from them for.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure, exactly, what you think they should have done as I think their decision was reasonable given Hardsuit Labs fucking up their release schedule so badly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T10:59:35-08:00","id":1529918,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>AnubisXy</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529900#post1529900\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"