fans or the broader casual game audience with that display. Obviously, people looking for fun combat are the ones who are less likely to buy the game initially and the one you'll have to advertise to.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T15:54:09-08:00","id":1529939,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529917#post1529917\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Hardsuit Labs is the one who fired Mitsoda and Avellone before removing their content.<br /> <br /> Which Paradox Interactive then took the game from them for.<br /> <br /> I'm not sure, exactly, what you think they should have done as I think their decision was reasonable given Hardsuit Labs fucking up their release schedule so badly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Frankly, I already said what I think Paradox should have done: just cancel the project. Bloodlines 2's window of opportunity is closed, and at this point it's just a case example of a game publisher faling victim to sunk cost fallacy.<br /> <br /> They'd have done better to start a Vampire the Masquerade: Redemption 2 project in its wake, hiring Owlcat or Obsidian to do the development given their chops and clout (and either's strong relationship with Avellone). Either would have been good, but after seeing what Obsidian did with Tyranny, they would be by far the preferable studio for a VtM game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/431-theodrim","name":"Theodrim","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar431_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1841"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T15:56:28-08:00","id":1529941,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Theodrim</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529939#post1529939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Frankly, I already said what I think Paradox should have done: just cancel the project. Bloodlines 2's window of opportunity is closed, and at this point it's just a case example of a game publisher faling victim to sunk cost fallacy.<br /> <br /> They'd have done better to start a Vampire the Masquerade: Redemption 2 project in its wake, hiring Owlcat or Obsidian to do the development given their chops and clout (and either's strong relationship with Avellone). Either would have been good, but after seeing what Obsidian did with Tyranny, they would be by far the preferable studio for a VtM game.</div> </div> </div> </div>Eh, they DID cancel it.<br /> <br /> The Chinese Room came to THEM with a proposal and claim they could do it in a reasonable amount of time.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T18:29:34-08:00","id":1529948,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529937#post1529937\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Well it depends if they're attempting to appeal to the V:TM:B fans or the broader casual game audience with that display. Obviously, people looking for fun combat are the ones who are less likely to buy the game initially and the one you'll have to advertise to.</div> </div> </div> </div>They <i>are </i>attempting to appeal to the BL1 fanbase. The dev-diaries were quite clear about this. It's not like they don't know what part BL1 fans are interested in. It's just that their chosen strategy has been a failure. And that the extended gameplay-trailer was a mistake in trying to make the game seem appealing to those fans.<br /> <br /> And if they are looking for people who like fun combat in general, the trailer will also have been a failure for featuring uninteresting gameplay. It doesn't help that this game is being sold at full price rather than mid-tier (30 to 40 bucks) which would be more appropriate for the level of quality that has been shown off thus far.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T18:42:03-08:00","id":1529952,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529948#post1529948\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> They <i>are </i>attempting to appeal to the BL1 fanbase. The dev-diaries were quite clear about this. It's not like they don't know what part BL1 fans are interested in. It's just that their chosen strategy has been a failure. And that the extended gameplay-trailer was a mistake in trying to make the game seem appealing to those fans.<br /> <br /> And if they are looking for people who like fun combat in general, the trailer will also have been a failure for featuring uninteresting gameplay. It doesn't help that this game is being sold at full price rather than mid-tier (30 to 40 bucks) which would be more appropriate for the level of quality that has been shown off thus far.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean it looks a lot like Dishonored and Dishonored is awesome.<br /> <br /> And they've said repeatedly in the gameplay review this is trying to show off the combat, aggressive social, and generally Brujah way of doing things.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T18:55:34-08:00","id":1529953,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529952#post1529952\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean it looks a lot like Dishonored and Dishonored is awesome.<br /> <br /> And they've said repeatedly in the gameplay review this is trying to show off the combat, aggressive social, and generally Brujah way of doing things.</div> </div> </div> </div>Uhm, no it doesn't look like Dishonored. At all. That's just a wrong comparison. A key part of Dishonored is a good big sandbox with good map-design. Also, Blink is a key-part of Dishonored which this game does not have. And the lack of a stealthy non-combat solution to the confrontation. Dishonored is just an inaccurate choice for a comparison here.<br /> <br /> And this was an &quot;extended gameplay reveal&quot;. It's not like we're gonna get another 30 minute video next week. And the part about showing off &quot;social aggressiveness&quot; of Brujah is just plain wrong as well. There was nothing like that shown. It only showed options that could be chosen for purely aesthetical reasons and then at the end, it was shown that only picking the aggressive options led to the bad outcome (Willem blows himself up). The choice of Clan Brujah had nothing to do with that. If anything, this trailer only demonstrated that outside of what powers you had in combat, the Clan-choice was portrayed as irrelevant to the gameplay otherwise. And that is another point in which it showcased a lack of attention to roleplaying within the game.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T20:33:23-08:00","id":1529958,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529918#post1529918\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Really?<br /> <br /> Because I assume the game is almost done and they're showing this section because they want to show they responded to fan feedback and made it more polished.</div> </div> </div> </div>I hope you're right. When they originally showed that scene, that was likely the scene that was the best quality and the best one they had to show. And it did not look good. It needed polishing badly, and presumably the rest of the game, or what there was, was in worse shape. They spent time polishing this one scene, releasing it several more times, but I still have serious questions and concerns about the quality of the rest of the game, which we haven't seen it. If this scene is the &quot;best&quot; that they have to show off, it's not reassuring me at all.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3},{"type":"\ud83d\ude0e","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/741-anubisxy","name":"AnubisXy","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar741_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5693"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T21:11:31-08:00","id":1529960,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Knightingale</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529953#post1529953\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Uhm, no it doesn't look like Dishonored. At all. That's just a wrong comparison. A key part of Dishonored is a good big sandbox with good map-design. Also, Blink is a key-part of Dishonored which this game does not have. And the lack of a stealthy non-combat solution to the confrontation. Dishonored is just an inaccurate choice for a comparison here.<br /> <br /> And this was an &quot;extended gameplay reveal&quot;. It's not like we're gonna get another 30 minute video next week. And the part about showing off &quot;social aggressiveness&quot; of Brujah is just plain wrong as well. There was nothing like that shown. It only showed options that could be chosen for purely aesthetical reasons and then at the end, it was shown that only picking the aggressive options led to the bad outcome (Willem blows himself up). The choice of Clan Brujah had nothing to do with that. If anything, this trailer only demonstrated that outside of what powers you had in combat, the Clan-choice was portrayed as irrelevant to the gameplay otherwise. And that is another point in which it showcased a lack of attention to roleplaying within the game.</div> </div> </div> </div>I mean, it's obviously a stealth arena.<br /> <br /> They just went loud.<br /> <br /> They also have a couple of blink moments, which presumably is a Celerity power as we saw it in JUSTICE and SWANSONG.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Author of <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Cthulhu-Armageddon-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01KUOM7SI/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982844&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Cthulhu+Armageddon\" target=\"_blank\">Cthulhu Armageddon</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Teenage-Weredeer-Bright-Falls-Mysteries-ebook/dp/B075TTN2FN/ref=sr_1_2?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982717&amp;sr=1-2&amp;keywords=Weredeer#customerReviews\" target=\"_blank\">I was a Teenage Weredeer</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Straight-Outta-Fangton-Comedic-Vampire-ebook/dp/B01KNHICCC/ref=sr_1_1?s=digital-text&amp;ie=UTF8&amp;qid=1535982774&amp;sr=1-1&amp;keywords=Straight+Outta+Fangton\" target=\"_blank\">Straight Outta Fangton</a></i>, <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Lucifers-Star-C-T-Phipps-ebook/dp/B01MDM9MCT/ref=mt_kindle?_encoding=UTF8&amp;me=&amp;qid=\" target=\"_blank\">Lucifer's Star</a>, </i>and the <i><a href=\"https://www.amazon.com/Rules-Supervillainy-Saga-Book-ebook/dp/B07MB89S33/\" target=\"_blank\">Supervillainy Saga</a>.</i><br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/onyx-path-announcements/206-forum-rules\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Forum Terms of Use</b></a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/contact-us\" target=\"_blank\">the Contact Us link</a>.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12002-ctphipps","name":"CTPhipps","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar12002_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"13933"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-02-03T21:30:40-08:00","id":1529961,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>CTPhipps</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-masquerade/1524819-vampire-bloodlines-update?p=1529960#post1529960\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> I mean, it's obviously a stealth arena.<br /> <br /> They just went loud.<br /> <br /> They also have a couple of blink moments, which presumably is a Celerity power as we saw it in JUSTICE and SWANSONG.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, a stealth <i>arena</i>. That's why the Dishonored comparison is completely inaccurate. And the only way to solve the sequence is to take out everybody. And of course unlike Dishonored there are only lethal takedowns here. The Dishonored comparison makes little sense.<br /> <br /> No, there were no blink moments... Do you mean the Dash-power shown in the video? That wasn't a blink of course. Also, the importance of Blink was about traversal. That way maps in Dishonored could have much more of a vertical dimension than would be accessible to a normal human. BL2 hasn't demonstrated having good sandbox-maps a la Dishonored.<br /> <br /> Besides, Dishonored also has an inventory and equipment-system - which BL2 doesn't have. The comparison just doesn't work.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2024-06-12T14:40:21-07:00","id":1537276,"title":"","content":"Developer Diary 13# is out today.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"b-bbcode b-bbcode__url b-bbcode__url--preview\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2/news/dev-diary-what-are-we-up-to\" target=\"_blank\" class=\"urlimg_container\"> <img class=\"js-img-fallback\" src=\"https://images.ctfassets.net/u73tyf0fa8v1/4GtNkTwc3KD5wcl5iZfw6H/412090a992d51ec9d468cacc1ccfab7a/bloodlines2-web-header.webp?w=1200&amp;h=630&amp;fit=fill&amp;f=center\"> </a> <div class=\"urlinfo\"> <div class=\"title ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2/news/dev-diary-what-are-we-up-to\" target=\"_blank\"> Dev Diary #13: What are we up to? - Paradox Interactive </a> </div> <div class=\"url ellipsis\"> <a href=\"https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodlines-2/news/dev-diary-what-are-we-up-to\" target=\"_blank\"> https://www.paradoxinteractive.com/games/vampire-the-masquerade-bloodl